{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"花蓮縣政府（以下簡稱本府）為辦理本縣都市計畫變更回饋代金之分期繳\n納事宜，特訂定本辦法。","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"fd0cf9fee96c919bc811b425307a0b6f3b0f470a21b7ad97df39922400a91471","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"回饋代金超過新臺幣二十萬元以上者，義務人得就超過部分向本府申請分\n期繳納。\n分期繳納期間不得超過二十個月，每期不得超過二個月。","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"5390cae4f06352172e7361c1ddab7c83e0a4941cc5a7194b94839f72981afa17","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"分期繳納者，應逐期按未繳納之代金餘額，依申請當月縣庫向金融機構透\n支借款利率計繳利息。\n提前清償者，回饋代金利息計算至前月為止。","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"c3459b0e8398c2ddd460d55c7b3d4bf42b7612aaaa5236077577117a9756d98b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"回饋代金繳納達應繳金額百分之五十以上者，得檢附金融機構之履約保證\n，向本府申請變更使用執照或營利事業登記。","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"ab89e182c7ffadf6ab93d372183aa2ba9342e85c001747e9a0ea6b05d1ba337d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"申請人申請分期繳納回饋代金，應檢具申請書（如附件）、土地及建物登\n記簿謄本、建造執照或使用執照影本及其他相關證明文件向本府申請。","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"acc42f581a913b322795c772b5e386abea93ce3d79088d344d7a03430426e2fa","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附件花蓮縣都市計畫回饋代金分期繳納申請書.DOC","url":"https://glrs.hl.gov.tw/glrsout/Download.ashx?FileID=165&id=FL043070&type=LAW"}],"category":"都市計畫與土地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"花蓮縣-FL043070","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"花蓮縣變更都市計畫回饋代金分期繳納辦法","region":"花蓮縣","source":"花蓮縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://glrs.hl.gov.tw/glrsout/LawContent.aspx?id=FL043070","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:46+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"1747b761a106e8dd0e9f42c30eef68ad9d4e6d1100722c2002d05fb625518049","sourceRecordId":"花蓮縣-FL043070","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}